    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join with up to 100 other players in this massive team battle arena game where individual skill, squad tactics, and overall teamwork will determine the victor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the makers of the Bloons series comes a brand new IP and brand new game genre - the massive team battle arena game. Mysterious cosmic forces have created the Fightland, and they\u2019ve plucked warriors from across space and time to do battle there. Split into 4 teams of up to 25 players each, each team has enough players to conquer objectives, defend their positions, attack other factions, and scout for loot - it\u2019s how well each team will coordinate and react that determines the winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 3 main hero classes, a range of primary and secondary weapons, outfits that enable both play style and visual style, discoverable Battle Assets that can change the tide of battle, and 3 varied game modes, each game is a unique, exciting challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR HERO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Going the Brute path gives you access to heavy-hitting weapons, slow but packing a wallop. With Rogue, you are fast on your feet, delivering quick, precision attacks. As a Mage, you can damage enemies at range, heal your allies, or join the fray directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/bf329e7d1ce45a6d1925a61adf545a84.avif?t=1755222114\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/5b02f3cd180623378f8111f6928e51d3.avif?t=1755222114\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/43314cc94a6eb485d365da1bf4921231.avif?t=1755222114\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR LOADOUT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 3 Hero types has bespoke primary weapons, secondary items, and armored outfits, with tactical and visual reference from fantasy to steampunk to sci-fi. All weapons and items are designed to support certain playstyles, with the opportunity to create mix and match hybrids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/ab77cc9a7241f075f3dec992fd2fc3b7.avif?t=1755222114\" width=700 height=552 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/089558ae08b2667073b4ba5c8fea29c1.avif?t=1755222114\" width=700 height=552 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/49c8686df893065e793151c63cec44be.avif?t=1755222114\" width=700 height=552 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR WEAPONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon progression is almost entirely lateral, so while you unlock new things, each weapon is awesome in its own right and is built to fit a variety of playstyles. But there is one key upgrade to every weapon - Weapon Mastery, where completing challenges with your favorite weapons will unleash their true potential and give them a stunning new look, too!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/4953e0a659b35659cff563045118c2c0.avif?t=1755222114\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/Featherlight.png?t=1755222114\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/fd6d3453ed27676e14f06b0711c45cfe.avif?t=1755222114\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMING SOON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > To stay up to date with Fightland's development and Steam Playtests that we will host prior to launch, please follow and Wishlist!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join with up to 100 other players in this massive team battle arena game where individual skill, squad tactics, and overall teamwork will determine the victor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the makers of the Bloons series comes a brand new IP and brand new game genre - the massive team battle arena game. Mysterious cosmic forces have created the Fightland, and they\u2019ve plucked warriors from across space and time to do battle there. Split into 4 teams of up to 25 players each, each team has enough players to conquer objectives, defend their positions, attack other factions, and scout for loot - it\u2019s how well each team will coordinate and react that determines the winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 3 main hero classes, a range of primary and secondary weapons, outfits that enable both play style and visual style, discoverable Battle Assets that can change the tide of battle, and 3 varied game modes, each game is a unique, exciting challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR HERO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Going the Brute path gives you access to heavy-hitting weapons, slow but packing a wallop. With Rogue, you are fast on your feet, delivering quick, precision attacks. As a Mage, you can damage enemies at range, heal your allies, or join the fray directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/bf329e7d1ce45a6d1925a61adf545a84.avif?t=1755222114\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/5b02f3cd180623378f8111f6928e51d3.avif?t=1755222114\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/43314cc94a6eb485d365da1bf4921231.avif?t=1755222114\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR LOADOUT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 3 Hero types has bespoke primary weapons, secondary items, and armored outfits, with tactical and visual reference from fantasy to steampunk to sci-fi. All weapons and items are designed to support certain playstyles, with the opportunity to create mix and match hybrids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/ab77cc9a7241f075f3dec992fd2fc3b7.avif?t=1755222114\" width=700 height=552 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/089558ae08b2667073b4ba5c8fea29c1.avif?t=1755222114\" width=700 height=552 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/49c8686df893065e793151c63cec44be.avif?t=1755222114\" width=700 height=552 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR WEAPONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon progression is almost entirely lateral, so while you unlock new things, each weapon is awesome in its own right and is built to fit a variety of playstyles. But there is one key upgrade to every weapon - Weapon Mastery, where completing challenges with your favorite weapons will unleash their true potential and give them a stunning new look, too!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/4953e0a659b35659cff563045118c2c0.avif?t=1755222114\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/Featherlight.png?t=1755222114\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699550/extras/fd6d3453ed27676e14f06b0711c45cfe.avif?t=1755222114\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMING SOON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > To stay up to date with Fightland's development and Steam Playtests that we will host prior to launch, please follow and Wishlist!</p>",
